description=Supports normal Vanilla self-built safehouse claims and manual expansion of connected buildings and extensions on multiplayer servers. Multiplayer offline preservation for player inventories and safehouse storage: server-owned food aging, item condition protection and automatic safehouse generator shutdown and restart. Generator ownership requires placement inside the actual safehouse claim (Vanilla: building rectangle plus 2 tiles on each side); power range and neighboring properties do not count. Offline generator start attempts, including PSR backup starts, are blocked. PSR battery wear and charge remain under PSR control. Requires ZombieBuddy with the Java loader on server and clients.
